        rdfs:comment        "Transport of mature mRNAs derived from intronless transcripts require some of the same protein complexes as mRNAs derived from intron containing complexes, including TAP and Aly/Ref. However a number of the splicing related factors are lacking from the intronless derived mRNAs, as they required no splicing." ;
